DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets\n\nAbout the Performer\nRene Vac
	a is one of the fastest-rising stars in stand-up comedy\, known for his sh
	arp wit\, relatable storytelling\, and high-energy performances that leave
	 audiences in stitches. \nBorn and raised in Southern California\, Vaca dr
	aws from his Latino heritage\, family dynamics\, and everyday life experie
	nces to craft comedy that resonates with a wide range of audiences. His st
	yle blends observational humor with personal anecdotes\, creating a show t
	hat feels both intimate and universally funny. \nVaca has built a massive 
	following on social media and has performed at major comedy clubs and thea
	ters across the country. His 2026 Tour has been one of the most talked-abo
	ut comedy tours of the year\, selling out venues from coast to coast. \nEv
	ent Details\nDate: Thursday\, August 20\, 2026 \nShow Time: 6:00 PM (Doors
	 open at 5:00 PM) \nVenue: House of Blues Cleveland\, 308 Euclid Avenue\, 
	Cleveland\, OH 44114 \nAge Restriction: All ages welcome (21+ for bar acce
	ss) \nNote: This show was rescheduled from June 6\, 2026. Original tickets
	 remain valid. \nAbout the Venue\nHouse of Blues Cleveland is one of the m
	ost iconic live entertainment venues in Northeast Ohio\, located in the he
	art of downtown Cleveland on Euclid Avenue. The venue is part of the legen
	dary House of Blues chain\, known for its rich musical heritage\, stunning
	 decor\, and world-class sound systems. \nThe Music Hall at House of Blues
	 Cleveland holds approximately 1\,200 guests and features a standing floor
	 with elevated viewing areas\, giving every fan a great sightline to the s
	tage. The venue’s intimate atmosphere makes it perfect for comedy shows\, 
	where every joke lands with maximum impact. \nAmenities include multiple f
	ull-service bars\, a restaurant\, and the exclusive Foundation Room for VI
	P guests. Parking is available in nearby garages and surface lots througho
	ut downtown Cleveland. The venue is also easily accessible via public tran
	sit on the RTA Red Line. \nWhat to Expect\nRene Vaca’s 2026 Tour is a full
	-length stand-up comedy show featuring all-new material. Expect a high-ene
	rgy\, laugh-out-loud performance packed with personal stories\, cultural o
	bservations\, and Vaca’s signature comedic timing. \nThe show runs approxi
	mately 90 minutes and is suitable for adult audiences. Vaca’s comedy touch
	es on family\, relationships\, and the absurdities of modern life — all de
	livered with warmth and authenticity that makes his shows feel like hangin
	g out with a hilarious friend. \nVIP upgrades including Fast Lane Access a
	nd Foundation Room Access are available through Ticketmaster for fans who 
	want an elevated experience. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $36 – $75 
	(plus fees) \nSecure your seats now before they sell out — Rene Vaca’s sho
	ws have been selling out across the country on this tour! \n\nOfficial Tic
	ketsResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commis
	sion if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n
	All sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be r
	equired for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/rene-vaca-tour-live
	-at-house-of-blues-cleveland-3/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
