SUMMARY:Gary Owen: No Hard Feelings Tour LIVE at DeVos Performance Hall
DTSTAMP:20260819T033131Z
DTSTART:20260820T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nAbout Gary Owen\nGary Owen 
	is one of America’s most beloved stand-up comedians\, known for his high-e
	nergy performances and his unique ability to connect with audiences of all
	 backgrounds. The Cincinnati native first gained national attention as the
	 “Funniest Serviceman in America” after winning the Armed Forces Entertain
	ment competition\, and he has been making audiences roar with laughter eve
	r since. \nOwen has appeared in numerous films and television shows\, incl
	uding Think Like a Man\, Think Like a Man Too\, Ride Along\, and Little. H
	e has released multiple stand-up specials on Showtime and Netflix\, and hi
	s comedy style — which blends personal stories\, cultural observations\, a
	nd sharp wit — has earned him a massive and loyal fan base across the coun
	try. \nThe No Hard Feelings Tour is Gary Owen’s latest stand-up tour\, and
	 it promises to be one of his most personal and hilarious shows yet. Fans 
	can expect an evening of non-stop laughter as Gary shares stories from his
	 life\, his family\, and his unique perspective on the world. \nEvent Deta
	ils\n\nDate: Thursday\, August 20\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM EDT\nVenue: DeVos 
	Performance Hall\, 303 Monroe NW\, Grand Rapids\, MI 49503\nTour: No Hard 
	Feelings Tour\n\nAbout the Venue\nDeVos Performance Hall is one of Grand R
	apids’ most prestigious and beloved performance venues\, located at 303 Mo
	nroe NW in the heart of downtown. With a seating capacity of approximately
	 2\,400\, the hall offers an elegant\, theater-style setting with excellen
	t acoustics and sightlines from every seat. \nThe venue is home to the Gra
	nd Rapids Symphony and regularly hosts Broadway touring productions\, come
	dy shows\, and major entertainment events. The hall features comfortable t
	heater seating\, multiple bars and concession areas\, and a grand lobby pe
	rfect for pre-show mingling. Parking is available in nearby downtown garag
	es\, and the venue is easily accessible from major highways. \nDeVos Perfo
	rmance Hall is operated by ASM Global and is consistently recognized as on
	e of the finest performing arts venues in the Midwest. Seeing Gary Owen he
	re means experiencing his comedy in a world-class setting with exceptional
	 sound quality. \nWhat to Expect\nGary Owen’s No Hard Feelings Tour is a f
	ull evening of stand-up comedy featuring his signature high-energy style a
	nd crowd-pleasing humor. The show runs approximately 90 minutes and is int
	ended for mature audiences. \nOwen is known for his ability to work a crow
	d and make every audience member feel like they’re part of the show. His p
	erformances are spontaneous\, energetic\, and filled with the kind of auth
	entic storytelling that has made him one of the most popular comedians on 
	the touring circuit today. \nExpect stories about family\, relationships\,
	 and the hilarious realities of everyday life — all delivered with Gary’s 
	trademark enthusiasm and infectious energy. This is a show you won’t want 
	to miss. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $35 – $85 (before fees) \nPurc
	hase official tickets directly through Ticketmaster\, or find resale ticke
	ts through VividSeats. Both options are available below. \n\nOfficial Tick
	ets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commi
	ssion if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \
	nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be 
	required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/gary-owen-no-hard-
	feelings-tour-live-at-devos-performance-hall/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/gary-owen-no-hard-feelings-tour-live-a
	t-devos-performance-hall/
LOCATION:DeVos Performance Hall\, 303 Monroe NW\, Grand Rapids\, Michigan\,
	 49503\, United States
