SUMMARY:Nikki Glaser: The Stunning Tour LIVE at Ovens Auditorium (Night 2)
DTSTAMP:20260819T033131Z
DTSTART:20260821T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nNikki Gla
	ser is one of the sharpest\, most fearless voices in stand-up comedy today
	. Known for her razor-sharp wit\, brutally honest self-deprecation\, and u
	napologetically bold humor\, Glaser has become one of the most talked-abou
	t comedians in the country. From her acclaimed Netflix specials to her vir
	al Golden Globes hosting performance\, Nikki Glaser is everywhere — and fo
	r good reason. \nHer 2026 Stunning Tour is her most ambitious stand-up run
	 yet\, selling out theaters across North America and Europe. Glaser’s come
	dy is equal parts confessional and confrontational — she goes places other
	 comedians won’t\, and she does it with a smile that makes you feel like y
	ou’re in on the joke. Expect material on relationships\, pop culture\, bod
	y image\, and the absurdity of modern life\, all delivered with her signat
	ure precision and charm. \nThis is Night 2 of a two-night stand in Charlot
	te. Whether you missed Night 1 or just can’t get enough\, this is your sec
	ond chance to catch one of comedy’s hottest tours live. \nEvent Details\n\
	nDate: Friday\, August 21\, 2026\nDoors Open: 6:00 PM EDT\nShow Time: 7:00
	 PM EDT\nVenue: Ovens Auditorium\, 2900 E Independence Boulevard\, Charlot
	te\, NC 28205\nTicket Price Range: $65 – $588+\nContent Warning: Adult lan
	guage and mature themes\n\nAbout the Venue\nOvens Auditorium is one of Cha
	rlotte’s most beloved and storied performance venues\, located at 2900 E I
	ndependence Boulevard. With a seating capacity of approximately 2\,600 gue
	sts\, it offers an intimate yet grand theater experience with excellent si
	ghtlines from every section. \nThe venue features Orchestra\, Mezzanine\, 
	and Balcony seating sections\, all with clear views of the stage. Ovens Au
	ditorium is managed by Blumenthal Performing Arts and is known for its war
	m acoustics\, classic architecture\, and the kind of close-to-the-performe
	r atmosphere that makes live comedy feel electric. \nParking is available 
	on-site and in nearby lots along E Independence Boulevard. The venue is ea
	sily accessible by car from Uptown Charlotte and surrounding areas. Arrive
	 early to find your seats and settle in before showtime. \nWhat to Expect\
	nNikki Glaser’s Stunning Tour is a solo stand-up performance featuring all
	-new material. Glaser is celebrated for her ability to make audiences laug
	h at things they’d normally be too embarrassed to admit they find funny — 
	her comedy is cathartic\, confessional\, and completely captivating. \nExp
	ect a high-energy\, fast-paced show with sharp punchlines\, unexpected tan
	gents\, and the kind of crowd energy that only comes from seeing a comedia
	n at the absolute peak of their powers. Friday night crowds bring extra en
	ergy\, and Glaser always delivers. \nThis is a solo headlining show. The s
	how is expected to run approximately 75–90 minutes. Seating is reserved — 
	arrive on time to settle in before the lights go down. \nTicket Informatio
	n\nTickets range from $65 to $588+ depending on section and availability. 
	Purchase official tickets directly through Ticketmaster\, or find resale t
	ickets through VividSeats. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post co
	ntains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\
	n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/nikki-glaser-the-stunning-tour-live-at
	-ovens-auditorium-night-two/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/nikki-glaser-the-stunning-tour-live-at
	-ovens-auditorium-night-two/
